with that skinny stick.

237
00:10:47,780 --> 00:10:51,070
Yeah? How 'bout I bust
your head open instead?

238
00:10:51,070 --> 00:10:54,740
If you think you can,
go on and try, pillbug head!

239
00:10:54,740 --> 00:10:57,200
