is dead!

243
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:11,050
Shibabawa? Was she killed?

244
00:11:11,110 --> 00:11:12,260
No.

245
00:11:12,260 --> 00:11:14,850
While looking into the future
for the next six months,

246
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:17,640
